[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5281.03, "timestamp": "01:28:01", "text": "就像，嗯，嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5284.47, "timestamp": "01:28:04", "text": "是的是的，我做到了，然后我有了我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5288.51, "timestamp": "01:28:08", "text": "朋友们暂时担任版主。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5292.229, "timestamp": "01:28:12", "text": "然后他们就走了，然后我就得应付了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5294.91, "timestamp": "01:28:14", "text": "其他一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5297.03, "timestamp": "01:28:17", "text": "我认为旧版本中没有这个问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5298.99, "timestamp": "01:28:18", "text": "锻炼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5332.189, "timestamp": "01:28:52", "text": "哦，这家伙有电击装置。什么是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5335.26, "timestamp": "01:28:55", "text": "这把刀？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5339.43, "timestamp": "01:28:59", "text": "[音乐]"}]